Subject: [PATCH 3/3] keyless relay: record EIA release date, next release
 date, raw thousand barrels and page hash for WCESTUS1

The site now judges crude-inventory freshness by the official release
schedule (valid until the next release date) instead of a fixed number
of days after the observation week.

